                    source text indicated that the Secretary of State saw this memorandum on Apr.
                    29.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d482-f2" n="2" xml:id="d482-f2-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic"><ref target="#d482">Supra</ref></hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d482-f3" n="3" xml:id="d482-f3-content">
                <p>That approval was transmitted in telegram JCS
                    937607 to Clark, Apr. 28, not printed.
                        (Matthews files, lot 53 D 413)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
